game-specific-link.toml and edge.toml are unchanged since this crate's prior pin at #134's commit
7aaa37bb36d7f36662a2f88ef75c3dbafb3f3327 (same blob ids at both commits); only the head moved and
two vectors were added.

Vendored by hand, apart from tests/goldens/astraplugins/ (whose PIN is a commit of AstraPlugins
master, db52804, and whose SHA256SUMS and git objects tools/vendor-astraplugins-goldens.sh
writes): tests/link_digest.rs holds each file here to its blob id at that head instead, and the
launcher's digest of it to the vector. game-specific-link.toml is also the golden vendored at the
pin, byte for byte; the test says so too.

When #134 merges, re-pin tests/goldens/astraplugins/ to its merge commit
(tools/vendor-astraplugins-goldens.sh), read the vectors out of the pinned vectors.json and
delete this folder (docs/ENGINE-DESCRIPTORS-DEBT.md row 53).

